   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
             <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/><!--facs="local:"-->
            <ab xml:id="MP2150_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>nʾmk' Y hwṭʾyk' QDM
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>lʾdynšn Y TMH ʿL
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/>DʿYṬWN[sṭn' MH ](P)WN bʾp̄lwn'
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>krṭn' LṬMH ZK Y zydʾn' (Y)
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/>krṭ' lʾd LʿYN' YḤWWNt
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP2150_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>nāmag ī xwadāyīg abar
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>rāyēnišn ī ānōh ō
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>dān[istan čē]pad Bābilōn
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>kardan ēdar ān ī zyān (ī)
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>kard rāy pēš būd
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP2150_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Your document on
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>organizing there for
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>knowing [what] to do for Bābilōn (i.e. Old Cairo.)
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>here because of the shortage that was
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>produced it was done before.
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
   </text>
</TEI>